{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>נחלו, שחו</b> — two words joined. That is, folly is their inheritance." "<b>יכתירו</b> — they acquire the crown of knowledge and ascend to the greatness of the wise; therefore the simple, who are the fools, bow down before the prudent, who are both good and wicked, and the righteous — the matter doubled."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:45.755677261Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}